# HyprK: controls, motion helpers and design tokens shared by shell/, settings/ and finder/.
# shell/ and settings/ are Quickshell configs, which only resolve imports inside their root, so each
# has a symlink HyprK -> ../ui/HyprK (shell: import qs.HyprK, settings: import "HyprK" relatively,
# which also works under the plain qml tool). finder/ adds ui/ to its QML import path (import HyprK).
# No Quickshell imports in here. Controls are controlled: they show checked/currentIndex/value and
# emit toggled/activated/moved; the caller owns the state.
module HyprK
singleton Tokens 1.0 Tokens.qml
singleton Typography 1.0 Typography.qml
singleton Accent 1.0 Accent.qml
Spring 1.0 Spring.qml
FrameClock 1.0 FrameClock.qml
FrameAnim 1.0 FrameAnim.qml
FrameEase 1.0 FrameEase.qml
PressSpring 1.0 PressSpring.qml
ToolbarHighlight 1.0 ToolbarHighlight.qml
Materializer 1.0 Materializer.qml
MaterializeScale 1.0 MaterializeScale.qml
Button 1.0 Button.qml
GlassButton 1.0 GlassButton.qml
Switch 1.0 Switch.qml
Checkbox 1.0 Checkbox.qml
